                    "presentation_rect": [ -420.5882272720337, 1947.058786392212, 800.0, 127.0 ],
                    "text": "05 CONTROL\nFollow STAGE, VOICES and PROGRESS. If the mode is RVOLVE, Press STOP to finish."
